* text=auto
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cs text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.css text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.dll binary

# Vendored extensions are hash-pinned byte for byte (WebExtensions.Entries);
# checkout must never rewrite their line endings.
ExoLauncher/Assets/Extensions/** -text
*.gz binary
*.bin binary

# Browser extensions ship byte for byte as downloaded: their manifest hash pins every byte (WebExtensions.cs), and
# text=auto once rewrote their line endings, so the bundled SponsorBlock stopped matching its pin.
ExoLauncher/Assets/Extensions/** -text
